	"Author": "lanterncat",
	"Description": "[b]Currently, includes the following TMX buildables:[/b]\n<br />   \uFEFF- Torii (large version and small version)   \n<br />   \uFEFF- Five different food stands, each of which is seasonal:\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- Ramen \n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- Dango (sweet dumplings)\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- Yakitori (skewered chicken)\n<br />      - Takoyaki (octopus balls)   \n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- Taiyaki (fish-shaped cake)\n<br />   \uFEFF- Ishigantou (Okinawan stone tablet meant to ward off evil)\n<br />\n<br />[b]How to Obtain (in-game):[/b]\n<br />   \uFEFF- Press F2 to access TMXL's building interface. \n<br />   \uFEFF- Select the building icon and place it.\n<br />\n<br />[b]Also currently includes the following JA items:[/b]\n<br />   \uFEFF- Three lamps:\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- small wooden lantern \n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- wooden lantern   \n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- stone lantern\n<br />\n<br />[b]How to Obtain:[/b]\n<br />   \uFEFF- Reach Farming level 4 to gain the crafting recipe.\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- Small wooden lantern: 1 torch and 25 wood.\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- Wooden lantern: 1 torch and 50 wood.\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF- Stone lantern: 1 torch and 50 stone.\n<br />\n<br />Inspired by sonreirblah's [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/3947]Seasonal Japanese Buildings[/url]\uFEFF and intended to be used alongside them.",
